      "message": "fix(sim): turning, rotary and probe keep the strict #864 law\n\nTheir laws also guard a holder, bar, shank or stylus. A wall may stand\nthe whole excess nearer than its facets show, so these kinds never take\nthe #2996 widening. verify::strict_floor is the #864 law, and the program\ngate reads it for these kinds (fidelity_law::widens).\n\nRefs #2996\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
